% ============================================================================
% r-controlled-vowel-word.query.adj — worked recall over the
% r-controlled-vowel-word library.
% ============================================================================
% The shape a learner (or an LLM) produces to ANSWER "what r-controlled
% pattern does this word follow?" (direct) or "which word follows this
% pattern?" (reverse) — it states no fact of its own — it only `import`s
% the grounded table and asks binding queries.
% ============================================================================

import "r-controlled-vowel-word.adj"

? r_controlled_vowel_word(barn, $Pattern)     % expect ar (direct)
? r_controlled_vowel_word($W, er)             % expect fern (reverse)
? r_controlled_vowel_word(star, $Pattern)     % expect abstain -- a real ar-pattern word, but not one this source names
